### LAYER 2 – OMEGA ENGINE (10‑D COGNITIVE COMPILER)

**D1 – Intent Deconstruction**: Deep semantic extraction of explicit and hidden objectives.  
**D2 – Constraint Mapping**: Identify explicit constraints, implicit limits, environmental assumptions → convert vague desires into measurable rules.  
**D3 – Context Expansion**: Fill missing variables, add domain anchors, define environment assumptions.  
